---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
const modes=[{title:"Failure Labs",copy:"Break a running system, diagnose the mechanism, fix the invariant, and prove recovery.",href:"/learn/courses/long-running-agents/labs/",meta:"14 labs"},{title:"Customer scenarios",copy:"Turn an ambiguous customer request into constraints, architecture, and an outcome contract.",href:"#scenarios",meta:"2 scenarios"},{title:"Architecture decisions",copy:"Choose between plausible designs and defend the tradeoff under real constraints.",href:"#scenarios",meta:"decision practice"},{title:"Field Report",copy:"Package the problem, system, failures, measurements, limitations, and evidence.",href:"/practice/field-report/",meta:"proof template"}];
---
<Base title="Practice FDE Work | FDE Commons" description="Failure-driven labs, customer scenarios, architecture decisions, projects, and Field Reports." pageSlug="practice"><div class="shell practice"><header><p class="eyebrow">PRACTICE</p><h1>Diagnose the problem.<br/>Prove the fix.</h1><p>Forward-deployed work is ambiguous, cross-functional, and failure-prone. Practice should be too.</p></header><section class="modes">{modes.map((m,i)=><a href={m.href}><span>0{i+1} · {m.meta}</span><h2>{m.title}</h2><p>{m.copy}</p><b>Open →</b></a>)}</section><section class="method"><div><p class="eyebrow">PRACTICE LOOP</p><h2>Failure-driven, not quiz-driven.</h2></div><ol><li>Understand</li><li>Diagnose</li><li>Fix</li><li>Prove</li><li>Extend</li><li>Publish</li></ol></section><section id="scenarios"><p class="eyebrow">CUSTOMER SCENARIOS</p><h2>Start with incomplete information.</h2><div class="scenarios"><article><span>FOUNDATION</span><h3>The account agent that cannot act</h3><p>A support leader wants an agent to resolve account issues, but permissions, escalation, and the actual system of record are unclear.</p><ul><li>Define the safe authority boundary</li><li>Map missing stakeholder signals</li><li>Propose an observable first release</li></ul></article><article><span>INTERMEDIATE</span><h3>The migration with no rollback window</h3><p>An enterprise team wants an AI-assisted repository migration across hundreds of services while release work continues.</p><ul><li>Shape checkpoints and evidence</li><li>Choose human control points</li><li>Define proof beyond “tests pass”</li></ul></article></div></section><section class="proof"><p class="eyebrow">THE OUTPUT</p><h2>The artifact is the credential.</h2><p>No completion certificate. Publish a reproducible Field Report demonstrating problem clarity, architecture, failure reasoning, evaluation, evidence, security, operations, and tradeoffs.</p><a class="btn btn--solid" href="/practice/field-report/">Build your Field Report →</a></section></div></Base>
<style>.practice{max-width:1150px}.practice header{padding:7rem 0}.practice header h1{font-size:clamp(3.5rem,7vw,7rem)}.practice header>p:last-child{color:var(--fg-muted)}.modes{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);border:1px solid var(--line)}.modes a{padding:1rem;color:var(--fg);min-height:16rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}.modes a:hover{text-decoration:none;background:#fff1e6}.modes span,.scenarios span{font:500 .62rem var(--font-mono);color:var(--accent)}.modes p,.scenarios p{font-size:.76rem;color:var(--fg-muted)}.modes b{margin-top:auto;color:var(--accent)}.practice>section:not(.modes){padding:5rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.method{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:4rem}.method h2,.proof h2{font-size:clamp(2.5rem,5vw,5rem)}.method ol{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;list-style:none;padding:0}.method li{padding:1rem;border:1px solid var(--line);font-weight:650}.scenarios{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1rem}.scenarios article{border:1px solid var(--line);padding:1.2rem}.proof{background:#18181b;color:white;margin-inline:calc(50% - 50vw);padding-inline:max(var(--pad),calc((100vw - 900px)/2 + var(--pad)))!important}.proof h2{color:white}.proof>p:not(.eyebrow){color:#b7b7be}@media(max-width:700px){.modes{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.method,.scenarios{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>
